# {{project_title}}

> Generated with `aistrap` using the `fastapi` template.

A FastAPI backend ready for AI workloads, with a `/health` endpoint, settings
loaded from the environment, tests and a Dockerfile.

## Project structure

```
{{project_name}}/
├── app/
│   ├── api/
│   │   └── routes.py    # HTTP routes, including /health
│   ├── config.py        # Settings loaded from the environment
│   └── main.py          # FastAPI application factory
├── config/              # Configuration files
├── data/                # Datasets (git-ignored by default)
├── tests/               # pytest test suite
├── .env.example
├── Dockerfile
├── pytest.ini
└── requirements.txt
```

## Getting started

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate        # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env             # Windows: copy .env.example .env
```

## Run the API

```bash
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

Then open:

- http://127.0.0.1:8000/health - health check
- http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs - interactive API documentation

```bash
curl http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
# {"status":"ok","app":"{{project_name}}","version":"0.1.0"}
```

## Run the tests

```bash
pytest
```

## Run with Docker

```bash
docker build -t {{project_name}} .
docker run --rm -p 8000:8000 {{project_name}}
```

